      <description><![CDATA[<strong>清华学院里没见到的库克，被我逮到啦</strong><p>这几天身边各种朋友偶遇或者活动上见到库克 前两天他是来了清华，作为院里的顾问委员会成员 再就是苹果旗舰店、孵化器活动上见到他身影 替在孵化器路演展示的朋友开心！ 图一为AI生成 #AI异类弗兰克 #库克 #apple #清华大学 #苹果应用孵化器</p><img src="https://fe-platform.xhscdn.com/platform/104101l0323fm2dp60a06bbggu3r00000000005oa67qgs" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610160003/04a0133ea3aa81afb61f5429a7d502ca/notes_pre_post/1040g3k0326bnui1u4q1g5nm6daug8qkaqnjmsrg!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610160003/c2731aa45552b29af44a18909f3034e7/notes_pre_post/1040g3k0326bnui1u4q105nm6daug8qkacqfme90!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610160003/04a0133ea3aa81afb61f5429a7d502ca/notes_pre_post/1040g3k0326bnui1u4q1g5nm6daug8qkaqnjmsrg!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610160003/c2731aa45552b29af44a18909f3034e7/notes_pre_post/1040g3k0326bnui1u4q105nm6daug8qkacqfme90!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ec66abd0000000001006a8a/6ad0f57a000000001403b661?xsec_token=ABkx80yCyVtPq1RKk5-1XmtcGCU_ICxqgvOh7FtpkJiOk=&amp;xsec_source=pc_user">原文</a></p>]]></description>
