      <category>xhs</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<strong>Coding用Step5Preview，复杂任务效果如何</strong><p>阶跃星辰新出的 Step 5 Preview，我前前后后测了一圈 官方给它的定位，叫往前推一步帕累托前沿 听着挺学术，翻成人话就是，能力差不多的模型里，它想做花钱最少的那个，同样一件活，别家要花 10 块，它想 3、4 块就干完 看到官方材料里给了几个数字。跑同一个任务，它的成本大约是 Claude Opus 5 的八分之一，是 GLM-5.3 和 Kimi K3 的 35% 10 月 8 日上线 OpenRouter，在 12 小时内 Step 5 Preview 就登顶了 Trending 第一。 能力这边，它在 Artificial Analysis 的智能指数上拿了 44 分，官方的说法是全球开源模型前三 便宜这么多，到底能不能干活？ 作为清华一名文科生，我想拿自己日常的开发项目试一试！ #Step5Preview #阶跃星辰 #howto手搓skill #AI异类弗兰克 #ai #vibecoding #step5preview</p><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610131304/5953b7c7c47c09ab4522dacf89535443/spectrum/1040g0k0326762jjmk6305nm6daug8qkatt64fb0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610131304/025c87845d3b9db64503ccaed8301a05/spectrum/1040g0k0326762jf14a005nm6daug8qka6qqead8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610131304/1605df5dbe85c5a04ca9941a9b4fec19/spectrum/1040g0k0326762jf14a0g5nm6daug8qkacomi5og!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610131304/c5c94b7721d42cea6a804f786ec8c94d/spectrum/1040g0k0326762jf14a105nm6daug8qka1eptkb0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610131304/838dc531e91d113abcf729c249871ba8/spectrum/1040g0k0326762jf14a1g5nm6daug8qka2annii8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610131304/f73cea2ca54cac6f95286de409c5520d/spectrum/1040g0k0326762jf14a205nm6daug8qkaltcmju8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610131304/251b4e6dd184f07bcc6e6e1d951c69ec/spectrum/1040g0k0326762jf14a2g5nm6daug8qkaj7p1e28!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610131304/fca7931200b4b5760b69b580492e577a/spectrum/1040g0k0326762jf14a305nm6daug8qkakq8r1hg!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3" loading="lazy" /><img src="https://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202610131304/a7086e2b0ee57e320387327